@baseUrl = https://chatbot-clinica-dental-production.up.railway.app
@adminToken = TU-ADMIN-TOKEN-AQUI

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Frontend
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Panel Admin (login por token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin

### Chat - Mensaje simple
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Hola, ¿qué servicios ofrecen?",
  "history": []
}

### Chat - Consultar disponibilidad
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "¿Qué horarios tienen mañana?",
  "history": []
}

### Chat - Mensaje muy largo (debe fallar con 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "",
  "history": []
}

### Consultar citas por teléfono (requiere ADMIN_TOKEN)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/citas?telefono=3001234567
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Cancelar cita propia (reemplazar :id con un ID real)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/citas/1?telefono=3001234567
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Cancelar cita como admin (reemplazar :id con un ID real)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/citas/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin - Listar todas las citas (requiere ADMIN_TOKEN)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/citas
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin - Exportar citas a CSV (requiere ADMIN_TOKEN)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/citas/export
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
